msgid ""
"At this time, GNOME 49 on SysV systems is known to be broken due to missing "
"user services functionality. This depends on a daemon that will be written "
"in December when there is more developer time to allocate to new projects.  "
"Please refrain from sending any bug reports if you are attempting a build of"
" GNOME on a SysV system. Note that applications are unaffected."
msgstr ""
